# label: alg:ch84-completion
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch84.tex:134
# caption: Attempt completion while retaining orientation and overlap obligations.

REQUIRE equations, reduction ordering, sound completion inferences, resource budget
ENSURE certified convergent presentation on success, or explicit unresolved outcome
WHILE an obligation remains and resources permit DO
  fairly select and simplify an equation under current rules
  IF its sides are identical THEN
    discharge it
  ELSE IF one side is greater under the reduction ordering THEN
    orient; interreduce affected rules; enqueue all new required overlaps
  ELSE
    retain unorientable obligation or return unresolved
  END IF
END WHILE
claim success only if every obligation is discharged and certificates check

